<title>UK: Japan's JFM prices $400 million 10-year Eurobond.</title>
<headline>Japan's JFM prices $400 million 10-year Eurobond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond has been priced, joint lead managers Merrill Lynch International and Tokyo-Mitsubishi International said on Monday.</p>
<p> BORROWER   JAPAN FINANCE CORP FOR MUNICIPAL ENTERPRISES</p>
<p>GUARANTOR  JAPAN</p>
<p> AMT	  $400 MLN  COUPON     6.75	MATURITY    03.JUL.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.998    PAY DATE    03.JUL.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.325     REOFFER    99.998    SPREAD	+23 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LONDON    PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/GB/JP</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  JAPAN     TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.125     SELL CONC  0.20	PRAECIPUUM  NONE</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 6.625 PCT U.S. T-NOTE DUE 15.MAY.07</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
